---
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const shopUrl = "https://grownby.com/farms/bold-love-farm-bakery/shop";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Bold Love Farm & Bakery"
  description="Learn about Bold Love Farm, Bold Love Bakery, and the local partners who help feed our community."
>
  <main class="page content-page">
    <div class="content-layout">
      <article class="panel content-panel">
        <SiteHeader currentPage="about" />

        <header class="page-intro about-intro">
          <h1 class="page-title">About Bold Love</h1>
          <figure class="about-intro-photo">
            <img
              src="/bakery-market.jpg"
              alt="Kim and George smiling with their dog at the bakery's market stand"
              width="845"
              height="900"
            />
          </figure>
        </header>

        <div class="about-sections" aria-label="About Bold Love stories">
          <section class="about-section about-section--featured" aria-labelledby="about-farm">
            <div class="about-story">
              <h2 id="about-farm">About the Farm</h2>
              <p>
                As a young family looking to get more fresh veggies into our diet, we joined a local CSA knowing it would helps us achieve that goal.  We were amazed at the abundance and variety of produce that can be grown locally, and how much better it all tasted than what we found at the grocery store.
              </p>
              <p>
                We went on to grow more and more of our own food at home and learned to make all kinds of dishes and
                to preserve as much of the produce as we could.
              </p>
              <p>
                This growing knowledge has brought us into farming and prepared foods, now doing
                for our community what we once did for our small family.
              </p>
              <a
                class="primary-cta"
                href={shopUrl}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Let us feed you!</a
              >
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-bakery">
            <div class="about-story">
              <h2 id="about-bakery">About the Bakery</h2>
              <p>
                I've always loved seeing the delight on people's faces when you hand them a loaf of
                homemade sourdough bread. The looks of it, the smell of it, the incredible
                taste—people's faces just light up.
              </p>
              <p>
                And when you give someone a fresh baked cookie that's made with ingredients that
                are all about quality and taste, not about how long they can last on a shelf.People often tell us they're the best cookies they've ever had. Delighting you is
                what the bakery's all about!
              </p>
              <a
                class="primary-cta"
                href={shopUrl}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Let us delight you!</a
              >
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-partners">
            <div class="about-story">
              <h2 id="about-partners">About Our Partners</h2>
              <p>
                What if we could get <em>all</em> of our food from local companies? From
                people who live in our community, who care about the land, the animals, and
                especially us, their customers.
              </p>
              <p>
                We don't have everything yet but we collaborate with many local companies to offer
                you produce, mushrooms, meat, cheese, eggs, jam, honey, microgreens, coffee,
                tea, and more. That's a lot and we're adding more all the time!
              </p>
              <a
                class="primary-cta"
                href={shopUrl}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Let us introduce you!</a
              >
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <SiteFooter />
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
